  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Domain",
      "items": [
        "UserModel immutable (@Value): factory create() y transiciones activate()/deactivate()",
        "VOs: UserId · UserName · UserEmail · UserPassword (BCrypt cost 12) · enums UserRole/UserStatus · DomainEvents",
        "Sin anotaciones de framework ni IO: nadie importa infraestructura desde aquí"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Application",
      "items": [
        "6 in-ports (casos de uso) y 7 out-ports desacoplan adaptadores de servicios",
        "Servicios: CreateUserService · UpdateUserService · DeleteUserService · GetUserByIdService · GetAllUsersService · LoginService",
        "EmailNotificationService renderiza plantillas HTML con tokens {{name}}/{{email}}/{{password}}/{{role}} y delega en EmailSenderPort"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Infrastructure",
      "items": [
        "UserRepositoryMySQL: raw JDBC, implementa los 6 puertos de persistencia",
        "JavaMailEmailSenderAdapter: javax.mail (legacy), text/html, STARTTLS",
        "Composition root Spring: DataSourceSpringConfig (HikariCP · jdbc:mysql) y SmtpSpringConfig (smtp.*)",
        "Seguridad stateless: JwtAuthenticationFilter + SecurityConfig (permitAll solo login, POST /api/users y Swagger)",
        "Desktop CLI presente pero inactivo: Main.java solo arranca la API REST"
      ]
    }
  ]
}